{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a2-roleplay-about-ordering-at-a-cafe-drinks-desserts-and-payment-methods-then-three-practi/audio/main-438524e00886.mp3","durationSec":111.096,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":2.74,"text":"A cafe order can start with a drink and something sweet."},{"start":3.52,"end":7.06,"text":"At the cafe, Maya serves hot coffee and cold tea."},{"start":8.32,"end":11.82,"text":"Coffee can come with milk, while the cold tea can come without sugar."},{"start":12.9,"end":17.12,"text":"These details matter because two people can order tea but want different drinks."},{"start":17.8,"end":20.1,"text":"A small cup holds less than a large cup."},{"start":21.14,"end":24.96,"text":"Maya also serves cake by the slice and cookies as separate pieces."},{"start":25.64,"end":28.92,"text":"A slice of cake and a cookie are two different dessert choices."},{"start":30.3,"end":33.36,"text":"One person might want only a drink, while another wants both."},{"start":34.66,"end":38.36,"text":"The drink, its size, and the dessert are separate parts of the order."},{"start":39.64,"end":42,"text":"Clear details help Maya prepare the right things."},{"start":42.88,"end":45.8,"text":"An order is easier to follow when its details stay together."},{"start":46.66,"end":49.28,"text":"The drink name tells the cafe worker what to prepare."},{"start":50.14,"end":53.86,"text":"Words such as small, hot, and cold make that choice clearer."},{"start":53.86,"end":58.04,"text":"At the cafe, Leo takes an order for a small hot coffee with milk."},{"start":58.7,"end":61.18,"text":"He repeats the drink details before preparing it."},{"start":61.46,"end":64.24,"text":"The customer listens and confirms that the order is right."},{"start":64.82,"end":67.46,"text":"A dessert can follow as another part of the same order."},{"start":68,"end":69.72,"text":"Leo then adds a cookie for this customer."},{"start":70.28,"end":73.76,"text":"An order can also include whether the customer will stay or take it away."},{"start":74.3,"end":77.52,"text":"This customer will stay, so Leo now has the complete order."},{"start":78.24,"end":80.12,"text":"Payment comes after the order is clear."},{"start":80.72,"end":83.34,"text":"Here, Maya accepts both card and cash."},{"start":83.94,"end":87.04,"text":"A customer chooses how to pay before Maya finishes the sale."},{"start":87.8,"end":90.6,"text":"With cash, the customer gives money directly to Maya."},{"start":91.14,"end":93.72,"text":"With a card, the customer uses the card machine."},{"start":94.4,"end":97.14,"text":"The bill should match the food and drinks the customer ordered."},{"start":97.92,"end":101.46,"text":"In this example, Maya notices an extra cookie on the bill."},{"start":101.98,"end":103.78,"text":"She removes it before taking payment."},{"start":104.2,"end":106.68,"text":"The customer then pays by card and gets a receipt."},{"start":106.68,"end":110.66,"text":"Fixing the order first keeps the payment clear for both people."}],"words":[{"text":"A","start":0,"end":0.22},{"text":"cafe","start":0.22,"end":0.48},{"text":"order","start":0.48,"end":0.7},{"text":"can","start":0.7,"end":1},{"text":"start","start":1,"end":1.26},{"text":"with","start":1.26,"end":1.44},{"text":"a","start":1.44,"end":1.62},{"text":"drink","start":1.62,"end":1.82},{"text":"and","start":1.82,"end":2.06},{"text":"something","start":2.06,"end":2.38},{"text":"sweet","start":2.38,"end":2.74},{"text":"At","start":3.52,"end":3.66},{"text":"the","start":3.66,"end":3.82},{"text":"cafe","start":3.82,"end":4.37},{"text":"Maya","start":4.37,"end":4.92},{"text":"serves","start":4.92,"end":5.3},{"text":"hot","start":5.3,"end":5.68},{"text":"coffee","start":5.68,"end":6.14},{"text":"and","start":6.14,"end":6.48},{"text":"cold","start":6.48,"end":6.76},{"text":"tea","start":6.76,"end":7.06},{"text":"Coffee","start":8.32,"end":8.54},{"text":"can","start":8.54,"end":8.78},{"text":"come","start":8.78,"end":8.96},{"text":